---
title: Features & Functionality
description: What's implemented in FOSSBilling and what's on the roadmap.
---

{% aside %}
This list isn't exhaustive. If something's missing, that doesn't mean FOSSBilling doesn't support it.
{% /aside %}

Use this page as a quick reference for what is available today, what is in progress, and what is still under discussion.

## Currency Support

| Feature | Status | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Multi-currency | ✅ | Some formatting limitations. Improvements planned. |
| Auto exchange rate sync | ✅ | Supports ExchangeRate-API, Currency Data API, and currencylayer. Enabled by default for new installs. |

## Security & Anti-Spam

{% aside type="tip" %}
Many of these features require the "SpamChecker" module. Configure it in **Settings → SpamChecker**.
{% /aside %}

| Feature | Status | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| IP blocking | ✅ | Block problematic IPs |
| reCAPTCHA | ✅ | v2 supported. More providers coming. |
| Stop Forum Spam | ✅ | Community-driven spam prevention |
| Disposable email blocking | ✅ | Uses [FakeFilter](https://fakefilter.net) |
| MFA/2FA | 🚧 | Planned before 1.0 release |
| Activity logs | ✅ | Track what's happening |
| Session protection | ✅ | Hijacking prevention and session limits |
| IP restrictions for staff | ✅ | Restrict admin access by IP (note: incorrect configuration may lock you out) |
| Security alerts | ✅ | Checks our [Central Alerts API](https://fossbilling.org/api/central-alerts/list) for vulnerabilities |
| CSRF protection | ✅ | Can be disabled in config if needed |
| Staff permissions | ✅ | Role-based access control |
| AbuseIPDB | 🚧 | Planned |

## Hosting

| Feature | Status | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Auto provisioning | ✅ | Accounts created automatically on order |
| Suspend/cancel | ✅ | Cancellation reasons not sent to control panel (FOSSBilling only) |
| 1-click client login | ✅ | Depends on server manager support |
| Custom domains | ✅ | Via nameserver updates |
| Domain + hosting orders | ✅ | Register domains alongside hosting |

## Domains

| Feature | Status | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Registration | ✅ | |
| Renewal | ✅ | |
| Per-domain pricing | 🚧 | Currently per-TLD only |
| Nameserver changes | ✅ | |
| Contact updates | ✅ | |
| Transfers | ✅ | |
| Domain locking | ✅ | |
| Privacy controls | ✅ | |
| Per-TLD requirements | 🚧 | Some TLDs need extra info. May be unregistrable in edge cases. |
| DNS management | ❓ | Under consideration |

## Core Features

| Feature | Status | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Network interface selection | ✅ | Modules must respect this. FOSSBilling official ones do. |
| Theming | ✅ | Custom themes supported |
| Email | ✅ | One outgoing address only |
| Invoicing | ✅ | |
| Usage-based pricing | 🚧 | Planned |
| One-time pricing | ✅ | |
| Recurring pricing | ✅ | |
| Promo codes | ✅ | Basic functionality. More advanced options planned. |
| Translations | ✅ | |
| Timezone support | ✅ | System-wide only. Per-client timezones planned. |
| File attachments | 🚧 | Planned |
| Virus scanning | 🚧 | Planned |
| Backups/exports | 🚧 | Planned |
| Restore/imports | 🚧 | Planned |
| Custom email templates | ✅ | |
| Auto-updates | 🚧 | Manual updates supported. Auto-update planned. |
| Modular architecture | ✅ | Unofficial themes, modules, gateways, server managers supported |
| Date/time localization | ✅ | |
| Bulk email | ✅ | Via "Massmailer" module |
| Referral system | 🚧 | Planned |
| Auto language detection | ✅ | Uses `Accept-Language` header |
| Email attachments | 🚧 | Planned |

## Tickets & Helpdesk

| Feature | Status | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Client tickets | ✅ | |
| Guest tickets | ✅ | |
| Email notifications | ✅ | |
| Auto ticket closure | ✅ | |
| Email-to-ticket | ❓ | FOSSBilling can't read mailboxes currently. Under consideration. |
| Ticket attachments | 🚧 | Planned |

## Invoices & PDFs

| Feature | Status | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| PDF generation | ✅ | Uses [Dompdf](https://github.com/dompdf/dompdf) |
| PDF customization | ✅ | Limited CSS support (Dompdf constraint) |
| PDF translations | ✅ | Generated in current language |

